    S:gt.blockmachines.bw.windmill.tooltip=Тип механизма: §eWindmill, Macerator§r\nA primitive Grinder powered by §bKinetic Energy\nMacerates up to§6 16 §7items at a time\nThe amount of parallels is determined by §bWind Speed\nParallels determine how many items are processed per recipe\nProcessing time is the same regardless of parallels\n§bWind Speed §7can be determined using the §eSimple Wind Meter\nRotor can be put in the §9Primitive Kinetic Shaftbox\nWill not work if wind is non-existent or too strong\n§c12.5% §7speed\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§62§7 parallels: §fLow\n§64§7 parallels: §2Common\n§68§7 parallels: §6Rather strong\n§616§7 parallels: §4Very Strong\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nУдерживайте §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 , чтобы отобразить рекомендации по структуре
