    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.pcbbiochamber.tooltip=Тип механизма: §ePCB Factory Upgrade§r\n§7Enables nanites to construct organic circuitry\n§7Unlocks the recipes for Wetware and Bioware circuit boards\n§7Place the controller block within §c16§7 blocks of the PCB Factory\n§7Left click the PCB Factory controller with a data stick,\n§7then right click this controller to link.\n§7Can connect to many PCB Factories!\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nУдерживайте §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 , чтобы отобразить рекомендации по структуре\nДобавлено: §a§9§lBlue§b§lWeabo§r§7 & §a§f§lgu§b§lid§3§l118§r§7
