    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.purificationunituvtreatment.tooltip=Тип механизма: §ePurification Unit, LPU§r\n§b§lWater Tier: §f6§r\nMust be linked to a Purification Plant using a data stick to work\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nDuring operation, swap the lens in the §fLens Housing\nThe multiblock will output a signal through the §fLens Indicator Hatch\nwhen the current lens must be swapped\nLens swaps will be requested in random intervals of §c3 to 15s\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nSuccess chance is boosted by §c10.0% §7for each successful swap performed.\nRemoving a lens too early will fail the recipe\nFind the order of lenses in the recipe in NEI,\nor use a portable scanner to view the currently requested lens\nThe recipe always starts at the Orundum Lens\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§b§oThe sixth step of water purification involves identifying any remaining negatively charged ions within\n§b§othe water which may cause electrical faults in future wafer manufacturing. Bombarding the water with varying\n§b§owavelengths of photon beams will impart energy into outer-shell electrons, causing them to detach from the\n§b§oatoms themselves and pass through the walls of the tank, ensuring the water is perfectly electrically polar.\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nУдерживайте §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 , чтобы отобразить рекомендации по структуре
