    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.solarfactory.tooltip=Тип механизма: §eSolar Factory§r\nController block for the Solar Factory\nProduces solar panels in bulk\nThe structure has 3 tiers, each allowing greater production than the last\n§f§lTier §b§l2§f§l and above:\n§a  Supports Multi-Amp energy hatches\n  25% more outputs for every Wafer tier used above the minimum required\n  The bonus to output occurs after parallels, and cannot be greater than 100%\n  The recipes shown in NEI display the minimum wafer tier required\n  LV-LuV Solar Panels can be made without the previous panel, but at a higher cost\n  §fPrecise Casing§7 Tier determines §6Parallels§7\n  §aMk-I§7/§9MK-II§7/§dMK-III§7/§6MK-IV§7->§a8§7/§916§7/§d32§7/§664§7 Parallels\n§f§lTier §b§l3§f§l:\n§a  Supports Laser energy hatches\n  ZPM-UV Solar Panels can be made without the previous panel, but at a higher cost\n  Bonus per increased wafer tier is raised to 50%\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nУдерживайте §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 , чтобы отобразить рекомендации по структуре\nДобавлено: §a§fPure§bB§3l§9u§1ez§r§7
