    S:gt.blockmachines.solarreflector.simple.single.name=Солнечный отражатель
    S:gt.blockmachines.solarreflector.simple.single.tooltip=Part of the Clean Green energy movement\nPoint me at a Solar Tower\nДобавлено: §2Alkalus §7- §c[GT++]
    S:gt.blockmachines.solartower.controller.tier.single.tooltip=Тип механизма: §eSolar Tower§r\nContributing Green Energy towards the future\nSurround with rings of Solar Reflectors\nThe Reflectors increase the internal heat value of the Tower (see below for formula)\nEach Reflector ring increases tier, the first ring is required for the Tower to work\nInput: Solar Salt (Cold)\nOutput: Solar Salt (Hot)\nEvery cycle (10 seconds), heat increases and all the Cold Solar Salt is heated\nConverting Cold to Hot Solar Salt reduces heat, equal to the amount converted\nThis conversion only happens if heat >= 30000 and controller efficiency = 100%\nIf there's more Cold Salt than heat, all the heat is used up and returns to 0\nThe heat increase is most efficient at exactly half of maximum heat\nMinimum efficiency at 0 or 100000 heat, maximum efficiency at 50000\nHeat Efficiency formula: ( 7000 - [|currentHeat - 50000| ^ 0.8]) / 7000\nHeat gain per cycle: numberHeaters * heatEfficiency * (10 + bonus)\nBonus: 1 ring  = +1, 2 rings = +2, 3 rings = +4, 4 rings = +8, 5 rings = +16\nTotal number of reflectors based on how many rings are built:\n1 ring = 36, 2 rings = 88, 3 rings = 156, 4 rings = 240, 5 rings = 340\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nУдерживайте §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 , чтобы отобразить рекомендации по структуре
    S:gt.blockmachines.solartower.controller.tier.single.tooltip_secondary=§fРазмеры: §615-31§7x§615-31§7x§628§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fСтруктура: \n   §fКонтроллер: §7Top center, 28th layer\n   §636/88/156/240/340 §fSolar Reflector\n   §6229-250 §fStructural Solar Casing\n   §666 §fSalt Containment Casing\n   §660 §fThermal Containment Casing\n   §660 §fThermally Insulated Casing\n   §e1 §fЛюк техобслуживания: §7Any bottom side casing\n   §e1+ §fВходной шлюз: §7Any bottom side casing\n   §e1+ §fВыходной шлюз: §7Any bottom side casing\n   \nРазмер стака проектора определяет §bNumber of Rings\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fЧтобы увидеть/построить структуру, используйте §9голограммный §1проектор§f мультиблочных структур!
    S:gt.blockmachines.sparge.controller.single.tooltip=Тип механизма: §eGas Sparge Tower§r\nRuns gases through depleted molten salts to extract precious fluids\nWorks the same way as the Distillation Tower, but with a fixed height of 8\nFluids are outputted one per layer based on the slot number in NEI\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nУдерживайте §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 , чтобы отобразить рекомендации по структуре
