    S:gt.blockmachines.substation.01.input.single.tooltip=Тип механизма: §eEnergy Buffer, PSS§r\nConsumes 5% of the average voltage of all energy type hatches\nDoes not require maintenance\nCan be built with variable height between 4-18\nHatches can be placed nearly anywhere\nHV Energy/Dynamo Hatches are the lowest tier you can use\nSupports voltages >= UHV using MAX tier components\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nУдерживайте §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 , чтобы отобразить рекомендации по структуре
