    S:gt.blockmachines.treefarm.controller.tier.single.tooltip=Тип механизма: §eTree Farm, TGS§r\n§4УСТАРЕЛО - Контроллер будет удалён в следующем крупном обновлении!\n§4Проверьте NEI, чтобы узнать о новом контроллере и рецепте преобразования\nFarms and harvests trees using EU\nPlace a sapling in the controller slot\nPlace a tool in an input bus\nDifferent tools are required for different outputs\nAdvanced tools multiply output amount\n  Logs: Saw (1x), Buzzsaw (2x), Chainsaw (4x)\n  Saplings: Branch Cutter (1x), Grafter (4x)\n  Leaves: Shears (1x), Wire Cutter (2x), Electric Wire Cutter (4x)\n  Fruit: Knife (1x)\nMultiple tools can be used at the same time\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nWork time is fixed at 5 seconds\nEnergy input tier multiplies output further\nOutput multiplier is equal to: 2*tier^2 - 2*tier + 5\n§5100 §7Загрязнения в секунду\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nУдерживайте §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 , чтобы отобразить рекомендации по структуре
    S:gt.blockmachines.treefarm.controller.tier.single.tooltip.15541=Тип механизма: §eTree Farm, TGS§r\nFarms and harvests trees using EU\nPlace a sapling in the controller slot\nPlace a tool in an input bus\nDifferent tools are required for different outputs\nAdvanced tools multiply output amount\n  Logs: Saw (1x), Buzzsaw (2x), Chainsaw (4x)\n  Saplings: Branch Cutter (1x), Grafter (4x)\n  Leaves: Shears (1x), Wire Cutter (2x), Electric Wire Cutter (4x)\n  Fruit: Knife (1x)\nMultiple tools can be used at the same time\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nWork time is fixed at 5 seconds\nEnergy input tier multiplies output further\nOutput multiplier is equal to: 2*tier^2 - 2*tier + 5\n§5100 §7Загрязнения в секунду\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nУдерживайте §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 , чтобы отобразить рекомендации по структуре\nСтруктура: §a§6EvgenWarGold§r§7
    S:gt.blockmachines.treefarm.controller.tier.single.tooltip_secondary=§fРазмеры: §63§7x§63§7x§63§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Полый)\n§fСтруктура: \n   §fКонтроллер: §7Front center\n   §68+ §fSterile Farm Casing\n§f   Входной люк: §7Any Casing\n   §eStocking Input Buses and Crafting Input Buses/Buffers are not allowed!\n§f   Выходной люк: §7Any Casing\n§f   Энерговвод: §7Any Casing\n§f   Люк техобслуживания: §7Any Casing\n§f   Выхлопная система: §7Any Casing\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fЧтобы увидеть/построить структуру, используйте §9голограммный §1проектор§f мультиблочных структур!
    S:gt.blockmachines.treefarm.controller.tier.single.tooltip_secondary.15541=§fРазмеры: §67§7x§67§7x§67§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Полый)\n§fСтруктура: \n   §fКонтроллер: §7Front bottom center\n   §660 §fSteel Frame Box\n   §657 §fAny Tiered Glass\n   §645-55 §fSterile Farm Casing\n   §625 §fDirt or Grass\n   §e1+ §fЭнерговвод: §7Any casing\n   §e1 §fЛюк техобслуживания: §7Any casing\n   §e1 §fВыхлопная система: §7Any casing\n   §e0+ §fВходной люк: §7Any casing\n   §e0+ §fВыходной люк: §7Any casing\n   §fОбязательный воздух: §7Interior center column\n   \nПодканал §bglass§7 определяет §bGlass Tier\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fЧтобы увидеть/построить структуру, используйте §9голограммный §1проектор§f мультиблочных структур!
    S:gt.blockmachines.universalchemicalfuelengine.tooltip=Тип механизма: §eChemical Engine, UCFE§r\nBURNING BURNING BURNING\nUse combustible liquid to generate power\nYou need to supply Combustion Promoter to keep it running\nIt will consume all the fuel and combustion promoter in the hatch every second\nEnergy output to the dynamo will be distributed over the next second\nIf the Dynamo Hatch's buffer fills up, the machine will stop\nIf the amount of energy to be produced is higher than the dynamo hatch can handle then all produced energy will void\nWhen turned on, there is a 10-second period where the machine will not stop\nEven if it doesn't stop, all the fuel in the hatch will be consumed\nThe efficiency is determined by the proportion of Combustion Promoter to fuel\nThe higher the amount of promoter, the higher the efficiency\nFollows an exponential curve exp(-C/(p/x))*1.5, where x is the amount of fuel in liters, p is the amount of promoter in liters\nand C depends on the fuel type. Diesel: C=0.04; Gas: C=0.04; Rocket fuel: C=0.005\nIt creates sqrt(Current Output Power) pollution every second\nIf you forget to supply Combustion Promoter, this engine will swallow all the fuel §ewithout outputting energy\nThe efficiency is up to 150%\n§aПоддерживает мультиамперные энерговводы и лазеры!\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nУдерживайте §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 , чтобы отобразить рекомендации по структуре\nСтруктура: §a§6TimTems§r§7
    S:gt.blockmachines.universalchemicalfuelengine.tooltip.32001=Тип механизма: §eChemical Engine, UCFE§r\n§4УСТАРЕЛО - Контроллер будет удалён в следующем крупном обновлении!\n§4Проверьте NEI, чтобы узнать о новом контроллере и рецепте преобразования\nBURNING BURNING BURNING\nUse combustible liquid to generate power\nYou need to supply Combustion Promoter to keep it running\nIt will consume all the fuel and combustion promoter in the hatch every second\nEnergy output to the dynamo will be distributed over the next second\nIf the Dynamo Hatch's buffer fills up, the machine will stop\nIf the amount of energy to be produced is higher than the dynamo hatch can handle then all produced energy will void\nWhen turned on, there is a 10-second period where the machine will not stop\nEven if it doesn't stop, all the fuel in the hatch will be consumed\nThe efficiency is determined by the proportion of Combustion Promoter to fuel\nThe higher the amount of promoter, the higher the efficiency\nFollows an exponential curve exp(-C/(p/x))*1.5, where x is the amount of fuel in liters, p is the amount of promoter in liters\nand C depends on the fuel type. Diesel: C=0.04; Gas: C=0.04; Rocket fuel: C=0.005\nIt creates sqrt(Current Output Power) pollution every second\nIf you forget to supply Combustion Promoter, this engine will swallow all the fuel §ewithout outputting energy\nThe efficiency is up to 150%\n§aПоддерживает мультиамперные энерговводы и лазеры!\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nУдерживайте §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 , чтобы отобразить рекомендации по структуре
